ass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2000,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, then the maximum power used by the motor is __________ <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.791ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18.633ex\" height=\"2.713ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -849.5 8235.8 1199\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6B\"></use><use data-c=\"57\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-57\" transform=\"translate(528,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(1722.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(458,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1235.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2291.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(3291.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4724.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(5224.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(427,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6055.1,0) translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-29\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>","options":[],"correct_options":[],"explanation":"<p>First, let&#39;s find the total weight of the elevator and passengers:</p>\n<p>Total weight = (mass of passengers + mass of elevator) \u00d7 g<br/><br/>\nTotal weight = (600 kg + 800 kg) \u00d7 10 m/s\u00b2<br/><br/>\nTotal weight = 1400 kg \u00d7 10 m/s\u00b2 = 14,000 N</p>\n<p>Now, we need to calculate the total force acting on the elevator as it moves upwards. Since the elevator is moving at a constant speed, the net force acting on it is zero. Therefore, the tension in the cable must balance the total weight and frictional force:</p>\n<p>Tension = Total weight + Frictional force\nTension = 14,000 N + 2,000 N = 16,000 N</p>\n<p>The power used by the motor can be calculated using the formula:</p>\n<p>Power = Force \u00d7 Velocity</p>\n<p>Here, the force is the tension in the cable, and the velocity is the speed of the elevator:</p>\n<p>Power = 16,000 N \u00d7 3 m/s = 48,000 W</p>\n<p>To convert the power to kilowatts, divide by 1,000:</p>\n<p>Power = 48,000 W / 1,000 = 48 kW</p>\n<p>So, the maximum power used by the motor is 48 kW.</p>\n","qKey":"1lgvtejbv","paperKey":"jee-main-2023-online-10th-april-evening-shift","exam":"jee-main","questions":[{"question_id":"1lgvtejbv","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 10th April Evening Shift","year":2023,"subject":"physics","chapter":"work-power-and-energy","chapterGroup":"mechanics","type":"integer","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>If the maximum load carried by an elevator is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.466ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.208ex\" height=\"2.163ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3628 956\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2000,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6B\"></use><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\" transform=\"translate(528,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> ( <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.466ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.077ex\" height=\"2.163ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3128 956\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"